# Auto rebuild after work

Whenever you finish a task that changed backend or frontend code (or Docker-related config), before ending the turn run:

```bash
docker compose up -d --build
```

from the repo root `D:\Works\XIX\label_anything`.

- Do this automatically; do not only remind the user to rebuild.
- Skip only for pure docs/rules/comments with no runtime effect, or if the user explicitly says not to rebuild.
- Prefer `required_permissions: ["all"]` (or equivalent) so Docker can run.
- Briefly mention that rebuild was started/finished in the final reply.
